# Bot2's Leyline of the Void ("if a card would be put into an opponent's graveyard from anywhere, exile it instead") and
# Bot1's Library of Leng both replace the move of a card Bot1 discards, and Bot1, the affected player, chooses which applies
# first (CR 616.1). Faithless Looting discards a Lightning Bolt and an Island. For the Bolt Bot1 takes the Library and puts
# it on top of the library: it never goes toward the graveyard, so the Leyline does not apply. For the Island Bot1 takes
# the Leyline: exiled, it is no longer going to the graveyard, so the Library is not offered (CR 616.1f).
[Bot1 Deck]
Library of Leng
Mox Jet
Mountain
Faithless Looting
Lightning Bolt
Island
Plains
Forest
Forest
Plains x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Leyline of the Void
Island x19

[Actions]
Bot2.Accept
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Library of Leng.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mountain.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Mountain.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Faithless Looting.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Choose(Lightning Bolt; Island)
Bot1.Replace(Library of Leng)
Bot1.Accept
Bot1.Replace(Leyline of the Void)
! Bot1.Accept
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T1 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot1.Library.Top = Lightning Bolt
Bot1.Library.Count = 11
Exile = Faithless Looting; Island
Bot1.Graveyard.Count = 0
